  "observation": "Six actor-14 primary-71 calls on the preserved ordinary field 23 encounter route compare exactly: five retries at PC 8ab while music result is ffffffff, then an accepted immediate-zero request that latches mode 5 and advances PC to 8ae. All thirteen captured boundaries preserve thirteen complete regions each (4516 range bytes;4512 distinct RAM bytes), selected SP/RA boundaries and the selector register. All 124 whole-run control artifacts still match.",
  "interpretation": "The authored request model recovers six ordered gate tests, lazy tagged selector resolution, mode-before-selector publication, request stores and final u16 PC arithmetic. The shared disassembler recognizes primary 71 and its retry/continuation successors. This is a request handler reconstruction, not battle execution or a player-readiness predicate.",
  "confidence": "confirmed",
  "validation": {
    "preconditions": [
      "Use exact selected Disc 1 CHD and decoded raw track; keep original captures local.",
      "Use the pinned Nix analysis/disassembly environments and preserved Ghidra export.",
      "Reuse the source-qualified EVID-REF-020 ordinary encounter route and its control run. The field-entry adapter has guarded setup; the encounter follows ordinary inputs.",
      "Choose fresh private outputs for replay/review; never overwrite original evidence."
    ],
    "commands": [
      "nix --extra-experimental-features 'nix-command flakes' develop path:./nix#analysis -c chdman verify -i 'discs/Xenogears disc 1.chd'",
      "nix --extra-experimental-features 'nix-command flakes' develop path:./nix#disassembly -c python3 .local/verification/phase-sequence-20260912/battle-request-source-review-v1/review.py --output <new-private-source-review-directory>",
      "nix --extra-experimental-features 'nix-command flakes' develop path:./nix -c env PYTHONPATH=. python3 .local/analysis/phase1-battle-request-20260912/replay.py --output <new-private-replay.json>",
      "nix --extra-experimental-features 'nix-command flakes' develop path:./nix -c env PYTHONPATH=. python3 .local/verification/phase-sequence-20260912/battle-request-source-review-v1/review_replay.py --output <new-private-projection-review-directory>",
      "Reproduce the fifteen historical corruption cases using previous-negatives.py with a fresh output path.",
      "nix --extra-experimental-features 'nix-command flakes' develop path:./nix -c python3 -m unittest tests.test_battle_request tests.test_event_analysis tests.test_event_state tests.test_event_media tests.test_field_control -v"
    ],
    "expected": "Original captured pre/resolved/after state is the oracle. Require complete sampled-region equality, exact pointer/source bindings and preserved control artifacts. Source-only branches must not acquire original execution claims.",
    "actual": "127 original words and 18 delay slots independently qualified/reviewed (113 handler/dependency words plus 14 adjacent helper words). Six original calls/thirteen boundaries match;124 controls and146 historical artifact hashes reproduce.27 new and15 historical corruptions reject.12 public request tests and49 related tests pass.45,437 independent source-formula comparisons and 13 projection field checks pass with synthetic scope. Final model promotion changes only docstrings; independent AST review confirms executable source unchanged.",
    "result": "passed",
